1. Create trajectory as pdbs from xtc in input

2. Use function below or similar to split into individual structures

function SplitPDBbyModels() {
    if [ -z "$1" ]; then 
        echo "Usage: SplitPDBbyModels <input.pdb>"
        return 1
    fi
    
    awk '/^MODEL/ {
      if (out) close(out);
      out=sprintf("model_%d.pdb",++m)
    } 
    {print > out}' "$1"
}

3. Adjust run_computation.sh to match number of minima and the location of script

4. Compute average with energies as second input


Folders:
Version1 - older version using fortran

input - xtc files as database

output -  e and rho files for each force
